    "detailed_description": "<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007930/extras/69c78ca0dac80712d91bd3bc396155bb.poster.avif?t=1752718440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007930/extras/69c78ca0dac80712d91bd3bc396155bb.webm?t=1752718440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007930/extras/69c78ca0dac80712d91bd3bc396155bb.mp4?t=1752718440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fallen Bride Mege is an adventure game developed by Wolf Holiday, published by OTAKU Plan.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007930/extras/0642fc7fce18223a0dac0ad776503159.webp?t=1752718440\" /></div><br>Mege is the childhood sweetheart of the protagonist. Lucky enough, he is able to marry Mege with everyone's blessing and lives a happy life.<br>But the sudden news of layoffs broke his peaceful days.<br><br>&quot;Ma'am, you don't want your husband to lose his job, do you?&quot;<br><br>In order to support her husband, Mege got acquaintanced with more and more people, and her peaceful life with the protagonist was gone...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2007930/extras/988a4aff11e4d06fc8091ce64493e363.webp?t=1752718440\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Animated character<br></li><li>Animated scenes<br></li><li>Visual novel<br></li><li>Mini games<br></li><li>Multiple endings</li></ul>",
